/**
@page reference Reference site

@brief `gh_mlb41` - the complete worked site every example is drawn from.

`gh_mlb41` is one real greenhouse, implemented end to end: its variable table, its
alarm conditions, its control programs, its shell command, and the simulated field
that animates it on the host. It is what the simulator runs, what the OPTA firmware
flashes, and what the @ref integration guides mean by "the site".

Copy it to start a new deployment.

- @subpage md_src_2sites_2gh__mlb41_2README - the directory: its files, the variable
  model, and how the firmware binds to it.
